{"decisions":[{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An agent is named by one agent id wherever the agent acts."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An agent id names a seat."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An agent id names a subagent by its seat's id and its own."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The pages an agent has read are the agent's own rather than its seat's."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An agent answers for the assignment the agent states."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An agent drafts into one set of edits rather than one set for each change."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An agent works at a terminal or at a seat with no terminal or inside another agent's turn."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/upkeep","statement":"Every act an agent leaves for later has a reminder set for that act."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A process a departed agent left running is taken away."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A subagent has departed once its seat's transcript records the result it returned."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Nothing a subagent left behind is taken away on a transcript that names it nowhere."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A subagent whose seat has no page has departed, since no agent is in that seat."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/constraint","statement":"A name exported inside a shell never reaches that shell's own environment."}]}
{"definition":"one an agent id names, working from a seat or under one"}
